## Getting started

<% if .IsGo -%>
```sh
make build   # compile
make test    # run tests
make lint    # run linters (requires golangci-lint)
```
<% else if .IsPython -%>
```sh
make install   # create .venv and install the package with dev tools
make test      # run pytest
make check     # lint (ruff), type-check (mypy), test
make run       # run the CLI
```
<% else if .IsNode -%>
```sh
make install   # npm install
make test      # node --test
make lint      # eslint
make run       # run the CLI
```
<% else if .IsRust -%>
```sh
make build   # cargo build
make test    # cargo test
make check   # fmt, clippy, test
make run     # cargo run
```
<% else if .IsTypeScript -%>
```sh
make install     # npm install
make test        # compile and run node:test tests
make check       # eslint, tsc type-check, tests
make run         # build and run the CLI
```
<% else if .IsDeno -%>
```sh
make run     # deno run main.ts
make test    # deno test
make check   # fmt check, lint, type-check, test
make build   # standalone binary in bin/
```
<% else if .IsGleam -%>
```sh
make run     # gleam run
make test    # gleam test
make check   # format check and tests
```
<% else if .IsZig -%>
```sh
make run     # zig build run
make test    # zig build test
make check   # zig fmt --check and tests
make build   # release build into zig-out/
```
<% else if .IsBun -%>
```sh
make install   # bun install
make test      # bun test
make check     # type-check and test
make run       # run the CLI
make build     # standalone binary in bin/
```
<% else if .IsJava -%>
```sh
make test    # mvn test
make check   # mvn verify
make run     # build the jar and run it
```
